        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/213763/The-Internet-Is-Bad-And-Getting-Worse-Especially-For-Queer-Kids",
        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://thewalrus.ca/internet-queer-censorship/\">A broad new law will end up erasing vital spaces and resources</a> <br/><br/>(slTheWalrus) Obviously, this focuses on Canada's current attempt to pass <a href=\"https://www.parl.ca/legisinfo/en/bill/45-1/s-209\">Bill S-209,</a> but touches on similar bills elsewhere in the world.",
