        "title": "No delay to iPhone Ultra, says supply-chain report",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/08/no-delay-to-iphone-ultra-says-supply-chain-report/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/10/iphone-ultra-fold.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">More supply chain sources have rejected claims of delays to <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/guides/iphone-ultra/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">iPhone Ultra</a> production, reporting that it appears to be on track for a September release.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">However, the latest report doesn’t rule out limited initial supplies of Apple’s most expensive ever iPhone … </p>",
