        "title": "Anthropic expanding Claude Cowork to mobile and web, details here",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/07/anthropic-expanding-claude-cowork-to-mobile-and-web-details-here/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/claude.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Anthropic announced today that it is expanding Claude Cowork capabilities from the desktop app to the web and mobile.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Claude Cowork on mobile and the web will start as a beta feature with a gradual rollout on select paid plans.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Additionally, Anthropic is extending Claude Fable 5 access to all paid plans for a few more days.</p>",
